  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Eyes of the World** (1 review): Reviewer found this song superbly performed, with visuals that were exceptionally strong [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lay Down Sally**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Dead Forever Clip**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2025-03-21.Rainbowtoez.Shell** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 180 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader mixed it on AirPods in a Miami hotel room, planning a proper mix later on speakers and car stereo [1]\n- **deadco2025-03-21**: source not stated; 18 songs; 178 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd 1st Set, Crowd 2nd Set [1]\n- Reviewer was attending Dead & Company for the second time [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2025-03-21.Rainbowtoez.Shell**: taped by Rainbowtoez; transferred by Hunter S II; source: Channels 1 & 2: Shure MoveMic 2 > Bluetooth MOTIV Audio > iPhone 12 [1]. Also: Lineage runs iPhone to WAV, then Reaper, then 24-bit FLAC [1]\n- **deadco2025-03-21**: taped by Rainbowtoez; transferred by Bootsy Jacobs [2]. Also: Recorded with Shure MoveMic 2 microphones over Bluetooth via MOTIV Audio into an iPhone 12, channels 1 and 2 [2]",
